igital noise, JPEG compression softening the edges, the casual, slightly messy look of a snap sent on a whim, with natural skin texture and visible ribbing on the fabric."],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"l4cie, a quick mirror selfie snapped in a bathroom and sent straight to her friends, taken on an iPhone without much thought about the framing. She stands at an angle to the mirror and holds her phone up beside her face with her right hand, the back of the phone with its beige case facing the mirror, while her other hand tugs lightly at the edge of her top. Her long platinum blonde hair is pulled up in a high ponytail with a few loose strands falling along her face. She wears a fitted charcoal gray ribbed strapless dress that hugs her body down to the knees, a thin gold chain necklace, a gold bangle on her wrist, and a small beige shoulder bag with a gold chain strap. Her lips are closed in a faint relaxed smile, her eyes on the phone screen. Soft daylight from a window to the side gives even, low-contrast lighting with gentle shadows on her collarbones. Around her, a white door with a metal handle, and in the foreground the edge of the counter with a clear zippered makeup bag, a makeup brush and a folded white towel, everything in sharp focus. Slightly tilted frame, mild digital noise, JPEG compression softening the edges, the casual, slightly messy look of a snap sent on a whim, with natural skin texture and visible ribbing on the fabric."},"color":"#232","bgcolor":"#353"},{"id":470,"type":"SkinDetailer","pos":[742.1697093940153,-1618.4974491181765],"size":[400,484],"flags":{},"order":15,"mode":4,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","type":"IMAGE","link":905},{"localized_name":"model","name":"model","shape":7,"type":"MODEL","link":null},{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","shape":7,"type":"CLIP","link":null},{"localized_name":"vae","name":"vae","shape":7,"type":"VAE","link":null},{"localized_name":"positive","name":"positive","shape":7,"type":"CO